          "settings": {
            "title": "ORDER YOUR BIKE",
            "content": "<p>Once you have chosen your bike, click \"Add to cart\" or \"Buy it now\" to proceed to the checkout. Enter your personal details and procced to pay the pre-sale reservation fee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "TALK TO A NORTON AGENT",
            "content": "<p>We will get in touch with you to discuss your purchase and gather any additional information that may be necessary.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "GETTING YOUR NORTON READY",
            "content": "<p>We will keep you up to date with the status of your order so you can relax while we build your Norton. We’ll let you know when it’s ready.</p>"
          }
        },
        "5ff145ed-112d-4d0d-8b6c-554c1589e87c": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HOW DO YOU USE MY PERSONAL INFORMATION?",
            "content": "<p>Norton Motocrycles take your privacy seriously. We will only use your personal information to provide the products and services you have requested from us or to administer your account. We may need to share your details with third parties in order to provide our services to you.<br/><br/>Our full <a href=\"https://nortonmotorcycles.com/privacy-policy/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://nortonmotorcycles.com/privacy-policy/\">Privacy Policy </a>is published on our UK website and is also available on request.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a1baf557-454e-4d54-b2bb-1f47a444b8ed": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "PAY YOUR BALANCE",
            "content": "<p>Once your Norton is ready, we’ll ask you to pay the balance via bank transfer. We’ll then book a handover date at your convenience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "4f50f761-6185-4a78-ad8e-242a3fcaafa5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "COLLECT YOUR NORTON",
            "content": "<p>Once your balance is fully paid, we’ll carry out a comprehensive handover and you can ride away on your brand new Norton.</p>"
          }
        },
        "180446e0-690d-44b7-aa4a-79e71ecba7c1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "TAKING CARE OF YOUR NORTON",
            "content": "<p>Your bike is covered by a 2 year warranty, so if you have any issues, please get in touch with a Norton agent and we’ll take it from there.</p>"
          }
        }
