        "question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the delivery options for online clothing orders?",
            "content": "<p><strong>UK SHIPPING</strong>: Orders are processed on the same day if ordered before 2.30pm. Orders placed after this time will be processed on the next working day.  </p><p>We offer the following service with Royal Mail:</p><p>Next Day Delivery: £6.99<br/>Standard Delivery (2-4 days): FREE for orders over £50.</p><p><strong>US AND INTERNATIONAL SHIPPING:</strong> Orders are processed on the same day if ordered before 2.30pm (GMT). Orders placed after this time will be processed on the next working day.</p><p>We offer the following service:</p><p>Express International<strong>:</strong> 2-4 business days following dispatch. Costs calculated at checkout.<br/><br/>Please note that in order for your order to be eligible for express, next day or Saturday delivery, it must have been placed by no later than 3pm on the previous working day. We do not ship items on Saturdays, Sundays or Public Holidays.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
